Image tag in html
<img> is an image tag used to import image from different location.
  We can copy the image address from the browser and paste in image tag.
  <img src="image link" width="100%" >
  src= source of image
width="100%" make picture flexible as screen and text.
<img> tag doesnot have end tag.
  
  * some may use / between img and src which is normal like this:
<img / src="link" > 
